  "description": "This package provides a robust and extensible framework for centralized exception handling in .NET Web APIs. It standardizes error responses using ProblemDetails, supports custom exceptions and includes a flexible status code mapping system. The package integrates seamlessly via middleware and service configuration, making global error handling clean and maintainable.",
